+// Engine-frame-boundary lease: a frontier never moves while acknowledgements
+// are pending. Failure does not release the lease; the lifecycle owner releases
+// it at EngineTickPost after choosing pre/post-ownership failure handling.
+class OnlinePrefixHandoff
